# Binary incompatibilities introduced since the 3.0.0 release.
#
# https://github.com/pjfanning/pekko-http-json/pull/104
# Adding the pekko-http-circe-base module moved the shared members of BaseCirceSupport into
# com.github.pjfanning.pekkohttpcircebase.BaseSupport, and changed the JsonEntityStreamingSupport
# in the streaming signatures from the javadsl one to the scaladsl one.
